# Generated by tools/gen-plays.mjs: the five Learn lessons on a phone (390 x 844, DPR 3) by finger: each
# lesson step done on the action tray (a refused Feed and Wash, a granted craving, a decoration from the
# drawer), Mote petted by a tap, then the pause sheet and Leave session.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 600 Daily Challenge
frames 10
touch =Play
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
# Lesson 1 — Feeding
touch =Learn
until 120 Lessons
frames 10
touch Lesson 1 — Feeding
until 300 Objective
frames 30
save lesson-1
touch =Mote
frames 10
touch =Feed
frames 3
touch Feed — unavailable
frames 5
frames 10
expect Lesson complete
save lesson-1-done
touch =Pause and menu
until 60 Leave session
frames 5
save lesson-pause
touch =Leave session
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
# Lesson 2 — Washing
touch =Learn
until 120 Lessons
frames 10
touch Lesson 2 — Washing
until 300 Objective
frames 30
touch =Wash
frames 3
touch Wash — unavailable
frames 5
frames 10
expect Lesson complete
save lesson-2-done
touch =Pause and menu
until 60 Leave session
frames 5
touch =Leave session
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
# Lesson 3 — Play & Rest
touch =Learn
until 120 Lessons
frames 10
touch Lesson 3 — Play & Rest
until 300 Objective
frames 30
touch =Play
frames 3
touch =Rest
frames 3
frames 10
expect Lesson complete
save lesson-3-done
touch =Pause and menu
until 60 Leave session
frames 5
touch =Leave session
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
# Lesson 4 — Cravings
touch =Learn
until 120 Lessons
frames 10
touch Lesson 4 — Cravings
until 300 Objective
frames 30
